# ctrim_app

Church/community Flutter app: events, information pages, personal section, bulletin board. Firebase: Firestore, Auth, Analytics, Messaging, App Check, Cloud Functions. Hive via `LocalDataManager`.

## Layout

- `lib/firebase/` — auth, functions, messaging, `db_managers/` (one per collection)
- `lib/models/` — plain Dart models (`event/`, `info/`, `user.dart`, `post_template.dart`)
- `lib/pages/` — full screens (`events/`, `information/`, `personal/`, `information_home.dart`)
- `lib/utility/` — `AppContext` (root `ChangeNotifier`), `InfoRepository`, prefs, local data
- `lib/widgets/` — reusable UI including `quill_editor_wrapper.dart`
- `test/unit/models/` — one `*_test.dart` per model

## State

- `provider` + `AppContext` (`lib/utility/app_context.dart`) — user, event heads, prefs, analytics
- `EventContext` (`lib/utility/event_context.dart`) for event-scoped state
- Call `notifyListeners()` only inside `AppContext` methods

## UI

- Localize user-visible strings (`flutter_localizations` / `intl`)
- Quill: `QuillEditorWidget` / `QuillViewerWidget` in `lib/widgets/quill_editor_wrapper.dart`
- Images: `photo_view`; video: `video_player`

## Constraints

- No business logic in `build` methods
- No `cloud_firestore` in pages/widgets (only `firebase/` and `models/`)
- No `print()` — use `debugPrint()` or remove
- Do not bump `pubspec.yaml` version numbers
- Check `pubspec.yaml` before adding dependencies
